 "title": "Keweenaw Bay – The Heart of Baraga County",
 "text": "Keweenaw Bay – The Heart of Baraga County\nSkip to main content\nSkip to footer\nOpens in a new tab\nThe Heart of Baraga County\nChamber of Commerce\nMembers Directory\nJoin Chamber\nMembership Benefits\nEvents and Opportunities\nSponsorship Opportunities\nDonation Policy\nBook Our Meeting Space\nChamber Committees\nLeadership\nBoard Meetings\nGallery\nEconomic Development Corporation\nAbout\nAnnual Community Update\nInvest in Economic Development\nStart a Business\nToolkits\nGrow My Business\nUseful Data\nFind Real Estate\nGovernment Relations and Advocacy\nCommunity Development Corporation\nCounty Government\nCounty Commissioners\nBaraga County Treasurer\nCounty Clerk & Register Of Deeds\nBaraga County Equalization\nBaraga County Sheriff\nDistrict Court\nProsecuting Attorney\nProbate Court\nCircuit Court\nRoad Commission\nEmergency Management\nVeterans’ Affairs Office\nParks & Recreations\nDocuments\nElections\nOur History\nJobs\nDiscover New Horizons\nProviding All the Resources to Grow\nJust Another Day in Keweenaw Bay\nDiscover New Horizons\nProviding All the Resources to Grow\nChamber of Commerce\nEconomic Development\nBaraga County Government\nThe Land Of\nOpportunity\nBaraga County, in Michigan's UP is a land of opportunity. With its affordable real estate, a business-friendly public sector and minimal competition, businesses can take advantage of the tremendous opportunity\nto leverage this economically friendly climate and the abundance of natural tourism assets available. And, with its spectacular scenery and abundance of trail and water activities for all seasons, it offers a unique opportunity to attract travelers and outdoor enthusiasts eager to explore this unspoiled, outdoor haven.\nIn The News\nIn The News\n> Chamber of Commerce, Economic Development Corporation\nBaraga County Chamber of Commerce Launches “Baraga County Cash” Gift Check Program\nNew initiative aims to boost local spending, strengthen small businesses, and keep dollars circulating close to home A Strong Push for Local Spending The Baraga County Chamber of Commerce has officially launched Baraga County Cash, a county‑wide gift check program designed to keep more dollars in Baraga County and strengthen the local economy. Community gift…\nRead more\nIn The News\n> Chamber of Commerce\n2026 ATV Wilderness Adventure\nThe Annual ATV Wilderness Adventure once again provided participants with an unforgettable ride through Baraga County’s beautiful backcountry. Riders traveled approximately seven hours through the wilderness, stopping at scenic destinations including several waterfalls, the Rock Cut, Slate Quarry, the historic train trestle, and Michigan’s highest point, Mt. Arvon, where everyone enjoyed delicious pasties for lunch.…\nRead more\nIn The News\n> Chamber of Commerce, Economic Development Corporation\nBaraga County Chamber Joins SBA in Showcasing Local Manufacturers\nBARAGA COUNTY, MI – As part of the U.S. Small Business Administration's (SBA) Upper Peninsula Community Tour, SBA representatives, the Baraga County Chamber of Commerce, and students enrolled in the Copper Country Intermediate School District Career and Technical Education (CTE) Business/Entrepreneurship course visited Massie Manufacturing. The students represent the L'Anse and Baraga school districts and…\nRead more\nWhat’s happening\nCheck out our calendar of events\n22 October\nDinner – Music – Raffles\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\n03 November\nVoting Information\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\n11 November\nNovember – Chamber of Commerce Meetings\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedin\nEmail\nView Detail\nNo event found!\nLoad More\nThe Heart of Baraga County\nCounty Government\n2 S. Main Street\nL’Anse, MI 49946\n906-524-6100\nChamber of Commerce\n1 N. Main St.\nL’Anse, MI 49946\n906-353-8808\nConvention &\nVisitors Bureau\n755 E. Broad Street\nL’Anse, MI 49946\n906-524-7444\n800-743-4908\nvisitbaragacounty.com\nEconomic\nDevelopment\n1 N. Main St.\nL’Anse, MI 49946\n906.226.6591 ext. 104\n# Explore BaragaCounty\nCopyright © 2026 • Baraga County\nSign In\nUsername or Email\nPassword\nSign In Forgot password?\nRegister\nEmail\nPassword\nRegister Already have an account? Sign In\nReset Password\nPlease enter your username or email address, you will receive a link to create a new password via email.\nUsername or Email\nSend Email",
